<ArticleLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="Child Savings Lab’s current monetization status and the standards that will apply before any affiliate relationship is introduced.">
  <h2>Current status</h2>
  <p>Child Savings Lab does not currently publish affiliate links, sponsored rankings, or paid provider placements.</p>
  <h2>If that changes</h2>
  <p>Affiliate relationships will be added only after the specific program permits promotion and the product can be evaluated with verifiable information. A clear FTC-style disclosure will appear near affected links.</p>
  <p>Compensation will not determine rankings. Fees, eligibility, investment choices, restrictions, and material conflicts will be sourced and compared consistently.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
